| LoopCore + 2x UQD08 + TFM orifice 10 kPa (recommended) | 26-29 | 18-21 | 10-12 | 99-115 |
| LoopCore + 3/4-in class pair + TFM orifice 10 kPa | 23-28 | 16-20 | 9-11 | 88-111 |

Recommended loop at 18 LPM, parts (kPa): couplings 4.9-8.7, hose 1.9, fittings 4.2, TFM cartridge+wells 0.8, orifice 10.0, plate 3.7

Catalogue Cv check, UQD08 pair at 18 LPM: Cv 4.75 (CPC max) 14.0 kPa; Cv 3.7 (FITOK) 23.0 kPa; dual pairs at 9 LPM each: 3.5-5.8 kPa

