## 6. Mixed loads on one manifold (equal-dP rule)

Power-shelf branch (2 kW, rated 1.2 LPM, intrinsic 4 kPa at rated) on a header set for 27 kPa GPU branches: draws 3.1 LPM (2.6x rated) unless its TFM orifice adds 23 kPa at rated flow. With 10 power branches per rack that is 19 LPM stolen from 324 LPM of GPU flow (6 %).

## 7. GPU-class plates (lidded, uniform heat over the lid footprint)

| case | flow LPM | CoolIT-like paste avg/max | LoopCore T1 PCM avg/max | LoopCore T2 LM avg/max | plate dP CoolIT-like / LoopCore kPa |
|---|---:|---|---|---|---|
| B300 1.4 kW, 45 cm2, 1.0 LPM/kW | 1.4 | 14.5 / 21.7 | 17.7 / 19.6 | 16.5 / 18.1 | 1.2 / 2.6 |
| Rubin 2.3 kW, 60 cm2, 1.0 LPM/kW | 2.3 | 16.1 / 23.5 | 18.4 / 20.3 | 16.9 / 18.5 | 2.0 / 2.7 |
| Rubin 2.3 kW, 60 cm2, 1.2 LPM/kW | 2.8 | 14.8 / 22.2 | 16.0 / 17.9 | 14.4 / 16.1 | 2.5 / 2.8 |
| Rubin Ultra 3.6 kW, 80 cm2, 1.0 LPM/kW | 3.6 | 17.6 / 25.1 | 19.1 / 21.1 | 17.3 / 19.0 | 3.3 / 3.0 |
| CoolIT 4 kW point, 25 cm2, 1.5 LPM/kW | 6.0 | 40.0 / 50.7 | 31.0 / 34.4 | 24.6 / 26.8 | 6.2 / 4.1 |

Die-zone estimate, Rubin 2.3 kW (2 dies, 16.6 cm2, 1.94 kW; split-flow passes ~65 % of 2.3 LPM over the dies, 16-20 mm path; LoopCore zoned comb sends 88 %):
- 1.0 LPM/kW: CoolIT-like paste 35.7 / 45.2 K; LoopCore PCM 27.8 / 30.7 K; LoopCore LM 23.1 / 25.2 K (die-zone case-to-inlet, no lateral spreading credit)
- 1.2 LPM/kW: CoolIT-like paste 34.0 / 43.5 K; LoopCore PCM 26.0 / 28.9 K; LoopCore LM 21.3 / 23.4 K (die-zone case-to-inlet, no lateral spreading credit)

## 8. Real 2027-28 package, hottest die cell (4 x 26 x 33 mm at 350 W/cm2 + 16 HBM, zoned), synthesis fit

- robust core R, PCM: 62.3 K -> Tcase,max 107.3 C
- robust core R, LM: 48.3 K -> Tcase,max 93.3 C
- performance core P (die zone only, 25 um loops), PCM: 53.5 K -> Tcase,max 98.5 C
- performance core P (die zone only, 25 um loops), LM: 39.5 K -> Tcase,max 84.5 C
- CoolIT-like split-flow (paste 0.05, flow over dies then HBM): 88.6 K -> 134 C; with LM ~76 K -> ~121 C

